{"id":"b66d459df317acb8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-range-positive.md","title":"每个 Omega 算子的值域具有正测度","display":"thm-omega-range-positive — 每个 Omega 算子的值域具有正测度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-range-positive","aliases":["43-thm-omega-range-positive"],"display":"thm-omega-range-positive — 每个 Omega 算子的值域具有正测度","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 18.4.3, special case S=2^ω","source_printed_pages":"559","source_pdf_pages":"579","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-range-positive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-range-positive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-range-positive — 每个 Omega 算子的值域具有正测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 18.4.3, special case S=2^ω"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"559"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"579"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])\">\\(\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)\">\\(\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。这些前提声明区间长度及测度完备性；函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 按其图理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists r\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(\\{\\Omega_U^A:A\\in2^\\omega\\},r\\right)\\in\\lambda.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists r\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(\\{\\Omega_U^A:A\\in2^\\omega\\},r\\right)\\in\\lambda.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只登记 Theorem 18.4.3 的完整 Cantor 域特例，不把“任意解析且 Turing 共尾子域”的推广当作已形式化。原书通过若值域零测即可由适当 oracle 编码该零测覆盖导出相对随机性矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 18.4.3, special case S=2^ω，印刷页 559，PDF 页 579。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。固定 $\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])$ 与 $\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]$，满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)$，以及 $\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)$、$\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal L)$。这些前提声明区间长度及测度完备性；函数 $\\lambda$ 按其图理解。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。固定 $\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])$ 与 $\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]$，满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)$，以及 $\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)$、$\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal L)$。这些前提声明区间长度及测度完备性；函数 $\\lambda$ 按其图理解。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists r\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(\\{\\Omega_U^A:A\\in2^\\omega\\},r\\right)\\in\\lambda.","display":true}],"bytes":1857,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-475","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-omega-range-positive]] — 每个 Omega 算子的值域具有正测度"}],"outgoing":["0680931785133191","8e999d59227f4a28"]}